# [WayX] COMPATIBILITY LIMITATION: native URL matcher retains source regex body; Loon flags i are not a verified target-engine equivalence.
^https:\/\/ggs\.myzaker\.com\/zk_article_ad\.php\? url jsonjq-response-body '(. as $__wayx_before | try (if type == "object" then del(.["data"]["article_bottom"]) else . end) catch $__wayx_before) | (. as $__wayx_before | try (if type == "object" then del(.["data"]["recommend_ad"]) else . end) catch $__wayx_before)'

^https:\/\/iphone\.myzaker\.com\/zaker\/follow_promote\.php\? url jsonjq-response-body '.data.list |= map(select(.type != "web"))'

^https:\/\/iphone\.myzaker\.com\/zaker\/car_tab\/index\.php\? url jsonjq-response-body '.data.gallery |= map(select(.type != "web"))'

